			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> it’s the managed service trap with a free tier. It’s easy to set up, and they’re hoping to keep you there with inertia and sunk cost fallacy.</p><p>That said AWS also has some major footguns.</p>",
