			"date": "2024-08-04T02:35:07.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> at some point in this journey, I hope you look into Fastly. Some major improvements over Cloudfront</p>",
