		},
		{
			"id": "112902171407843309",
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://front-end.social/@benschwarz/112902171387970893",
			"author": {
				"name": "benschwarz",
				"url": "https://front-end.social/@benschwarz",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/295/713/321/949/633/original/45e52f3c0901216e.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2024-08-04T05:46:57.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> this is interesting because I keep getting emails about hitting the function invocation limit. From poking around I could see lots of responses that weren’t cached at the edge, but should’ve been.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "112909708244923280",
			"parentId": "112902171407843309",
			"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat/112909708244923280",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/accounts/avatars/109/286/461/031/266/152/original/dc489c3746a44e00.png"
			},
			"date": "2024-08-05T13:43:41.220Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://front-end.social/@benschwarz\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>benschwarz</span></a></span> another distinction here is that I don’t think cached responses are excluded from invocation counts—but I’m not super worried about that since they charge $.60 per million there. It’s the $.18 per GB hour that is biting me (at ~42h per day usage)</p><p>correction: cached hits are allegedly not counted in invocation counts: <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/pricing/serverless-functions#managing-function-invocations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">vercel.com/docs/pricing/server</span><span class=\"invisible\">less-functions#managing-function-invocations</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
